    "title": "Hog truck rolls over south of La Crescent - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ashton Tack ,\n7 hours ago LA CRESCENT, Minn. (WKBT) -- A truck hauling hogs was involved in a rollover crash Wednesday afternoon, according to a release .\nThe crash happened on HWY 26 and has closed the roadway. Drivers are being rerouted to HWY 16.\nCrews are working to get the hogs unloaded into another truck so the impacted one can be moved.",
